      "content": "it's not just a \"failure\" though. it's my entire identity. i've spent my whole life building toward this one thing and now there is literally nothing left. i look at my lab partners and they're all moving forward and i'm just... stuck in this void. it feels like the version of me that actually mattered just died today. how am i supposed to just \"find a way forward\" when there's no road left to walk on?",
